   },
   "roundness": null,
   "text": "what is happening now\n  \u2014 read from code, infra,\n  product specs, not assumed\nwhat should be happening\nthe gap between them, MEASURED\npoint of cause, if the sensei\n  trigger fired at step 5\nthe value of closing it\nthe next stage's inputs",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
