   "text": ".md \u2014 machine-read,\nlong-read, measurable,\nhandoff-ready.\n\nVISUAL: a diagram of the\nidea, the interaction,\nthe flow.\n\nBOTH routes produce a doc\nAND a diagram. it is the\nSECTIONS that differ,\nnot the artifact types.",
